00:17:44.363 --> 00:17:46.297
cancer, and other
serious illnesses.

00:17:46.297 --> 00:17:48.299
They need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:17:48.299 --> 00:17:50.735
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:17:50.735 --> 00:17:52.470
Stay safe.
Wash your hands.

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:54.239
Wear a mask.
We love you.

